  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Recently I've been messing with the stretch and squish features for physbones a bit more, and decided to try out specifically using the stretch and squish motion, which allowed me to make some great looking physics with more dynamic movement which honestly looks really really good and is a really really useful feature. However a problem I now run into is that since I'm using squish. If my root bone is touched my chest kind of.......... caves in. So I was thought it would be really really nice/useful if we could just have stretch and squish only be affected by motion just like how we can have it be only affected by touch. Also it would be really useful if there were separate slider for stretch motion and squish motion, so that I could have the bones only squish from motion but still stretch from touch or just exclude stretch from motion entirely. Hopefully this all makes sense.",
